{"id":"f39968e4-3041-4a2f-b760-2551198cd968","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243636,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT mr.level_id AS referrer_level_id, mi.level_id AS invitee_level_id,\n       COUNT(*) AS referral_count,\n       ROUND(SUM(rf.reward_amount), 2) AS reward_total\nFROM referrals rf\nLEFT JOIN members mr ON mr.member_id = rf.referrer_member_id\nLEFT JOIN members mi ON mi.member_id = rf.invitee_member_id\nGROUP BY 1, 2\nORDER BY referral_count DESC LIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"- 表：referrals rf\n- JOIN members mr ON mr.member_id = rf.referrer_member_id\n- JOIN members mi ON mi.member_id = rf.invitee_member_id\n- 需要保留未知等级为NULL，所以用LEFT JOIN members（推荐人/被推荐人可能不在members里？未知等级保留NULL → 用LEFT JOIN）\n- GROUP BY 两个 level_id\n- 指标：COUNT(*) 全部推荐记录数，ROUND(SUM(reward_amount),2)\n- 输出两个等级ID和两项指标\n\n注意：reward_amount 可能为NULL，SUM保留NULL语义。COUNT(*) 计全部推荐记录。\n\nLEFT JOIN 保留推荐关系。GROUP BY 1,2。排序按推荐数DESC。LIMIT 需要（有GROUP BY，必须LIMIT？规则3：必须LIMIT，聚合单行除外。有GROUP BY需LIMIT）。用LIMIT 100？默认TopN至多N行但问题没要求N...还是要加LIMIT，比如LIMIT 200。用LIMIT 100合理。\n\n注意级别ID：referrer level id 和 invitee level id。未知等级保留NULL → mr.level_id 为 NULL 时仍出现在分组。\n\nSQL:\nSELECT mr.level_id AS referrer_level_id, mi.level_id AS invitee_level_id,\nCOUNT(*) AS referrals, ROUND(SUM(rf.reward_amount), 2) AS reward_amount\nFROM referrals rf\nLEFT JOIN members mr ON mr.member_id = rf.referrer_member_id\nLEFT JOIN members mi ON mi.member_id = rf.invitee_member_id\nGROUP BY 1, 2\nORDER BY referrals DESC LIMIT 100;\n\n注意 members.member_id 是主键，不会重复。OK。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2943,"completion_tokens":485,"total_tokens":3428,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":381},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1151},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}